Package: difftastic
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: structural diff that understands syntax
 difftastic (the difft binary) parses files with tree-sitter and diffs
 the syntax trees, so changes are reported the way a reader sees them:
 formatting-only edits show as unchanged, and real changes are
 highlighted within lines. Over 30 programming languages are supported,
 with a line-oriented fallback for everything else.
